{"page":221,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:107","surah":10,"ayah":107,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن يَمْسَسْكَ ٱللَّهُ بِضُرٍّ فَلَا كَاشِفَ لَهُۥٓ إِلَّا هُوَ ۖ وَإِن يُرِدْكَ بِخَيْرٍ فَلَا رَآدَّ لِفَضْلِهِۦ ۚ يُصِيبُ بِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ مِنْ عِبَادِهِۦ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If God inflicts harm on you, no one can remove it but Him, and if He intends good for you, no one can turn His bounty away; He grants His bounty to any of His servants He will. He is the Most Forgiving, the Most Merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَمْسَسْكَ","en_gloss":"Allah touches you","transliteration":"yamsaska","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah touches you","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِضُرٍّۢ","en_gloss":"with adversity","transliteration":"biḍurrin","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَاشِفَ","en_gloss":"remover","transliteration":"kāshifa","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُوَ ۖ","en_gloss":"Him","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُرِدْكَ","en_gloss":"He intends for you","transliteration":"yurid'ka","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِخَيْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"any good","transliteration":"bikhayrin","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then (there is) no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَآدَّ","en_gloss":"repeller","transliteration":"rādda","verse_key":"10:107"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِفَضْلِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) His Bounty","transliteration":"lifaḍlihi","verse_key":